# Studio audit workflow — scope the baseline to what intrusion detection needs.
# Container image layers are immutable and content-addressed: AIDE watching them
# adds ~760k entries (90% of the DB) and emits a huge diff on every image pull,
# which buries real findings. Excluded deliberately, not for convenience.
!/var/lib/docker
!/var/lib/containerd
!/var/lib/snapd/cache
!/var/cache
!/var/log
!/var/tmp
!/tmp
